sequenceDiagram
  actor traveler as Traveler
  participant orch as Orchestrator<br/>OBO processor
  participant idp as IBM Verify
  participant booking as Booking agent<br/>OBO processor
  participant mcp as Flight search<br/>MCP server

  traveler->>orch: 1. Trip request,<br/>user token
  orch->>idp: 2. Exchange token
  idp-->>orch: 3. Booking agent token
  orch->>booking: 4. mTLS call + token
  booking->>booking: 5. Verify token
  booking->>idp: 6. Exchange token
  idp-->>booking: 7. MCP server token
  booking->>mcp: 8. mTLS call + token
  mcp->>mcp: 9. Verify token
